# Dialogs stay UI-only

`src/Dialogs/` is clicks, layout, and `Save()`. It is product surface, not
a second toolkit.

## Freeze

- **Settings:** add rows to the existing `*ConfigPanel` in
  `Dialogs/Settings/Panels/`. Do not invent another configuration shell
  or port Configuration to `GroupedListWidget` until that widget is in
  `master` (Wolfgang’s branch). Then migrate one config group per PR.
- **No new UI layer:** `Widget` + `RowFormWidget` / `ListWidget` remain
  the page API. Do not add View/Presenter/layout-engine types.
- **No new download clients, parsers, or file-walkers** in Dialogs.
  Fetch and scan live in `Weather/`, `Storage/`, `Repository/`,
  `Device/`. Dialogs start/cancel/bind status and call `ShowCoDialog`.

## Allowed

- `CommonInterface`, `ActionInterface`, `ShowCoDialog`, `UI::Notify`
- Hosting existing glue (`*DownloadGlue`, repository helpers, waypoint
  helpers) without reimplementing them

## Weather overlays

Share `WeatherOverlayDraft` and one overlay-page host. A new provider
is a client plus a fill callback, not a new `*Dialog.cpp`.

## Search lists

Reuse list + filter + browse/pick close rules (see
`search-dialog-ux.mdc`). Do not copy another 400-line `*ListWidget`.
